     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Folks<div><br></div><div>Based on the poll I sent out a while ago, the most votes went to <b>Mondays 10am-12pm.</b> We&#39;ll meet in the DSI 360 room as usual, but we may need to shift over to Wickson on a few occasions if there are workshops going on.</div><div><br></div><div>If folks are interested in giving a presentation, please email me and let me know.</div><div><br></div><div>Video and material from the <b>sf </b>talk are now up on the <b><i><a href=\"http://d-rug.github.io/blog/2017/Ryan-Peek-on-using-the-sf-package\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://d-rug.github.io/blog/2017/Ryan-Peek-on-using-the-sf-package&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466641662000&amp;usg=AOvVaw13I2f9tIs5R95buNOcQaxe\">d-rug website</a>.</i></b></div><div><b><i><br></i></b></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks all!</div><div>Adios,</div><div><br></div><div>R*</div><div><br></div><div><i>*coordinator of D-RUG...of which there is currently one. Interested in helping out? Super! Let me know!</i><br></div><div><br></div><div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;w